{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セブン－イレブン限定ライブがありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装は『太陽ノック』歌衣装"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/25/0417763/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が今までこの衣装着たのは\n生写真撮影だけだったから\n2度目なの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛くて好きだから\n着れて嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/25/0417763/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日その生写真が\n販売されてるみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうコンプしてるのかな～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Overture\n太陽ノック\nガールズルール\n命は美しい\nバレッタ\n何度目の青空か？\n-MC-\n羽根の記憶\n扇風機\nあの日 僕は咄嗟に嘘をついた\n制服のマネキン\nおいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCまでの5曲は全部\nセンターが違う曲になってました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センターがあまり固定されずにやってきたのも\n乃木坂の色だよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂を知っていただけて\nさらに、盛り上がる\n代表曲を集めた感じのセトリでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/25/0417763/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的には『気づいたら片想い』を\nやってほしかった気もするけども\nでもいいセトリでしたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリジナルでできたのも嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/25/0417763/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nそのあとは\n全握のミニライブがありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Overture\n太陽ノック\n別れ際、もっと好きになる\n-MC-\n無表情\n魚たちのLOVE SONG\n制服を脱いでサヨナラを・・・\n-MC-\nもう少しの夢\n羽根の記憶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほとんどが今日初披露の楽曲でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『無表情』の合いの手できた？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/25/0417763/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裏まで\n合いの手の声がすごい聞こえてたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しそう＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから握手会始まります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/25/0417763/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セブン－イレブン限定ライブの感想も\nミニライブの感想も\n良ければ教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/25/0417763/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/25/0417763/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶんね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会のあとも更新すると思われる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい更新してごめんよ！\n書くことがたくさんあって嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.naka